From 2280b2e16b58cf856123ce7c2b7aa6a778685bed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pm-official-id <pm-official-id@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:56:25 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] LastWave skins, as a standalone 'Lokal Skins' app

Ported from Clash-Projects/LastWave-native: the signature Electric-Lime
(#C9FB00) on Deep-Obsidian-Teal (#012226) scheme in dark and light, plus
its six accent presets (Crimson, Violet, Ocean, Sage, Amber, Rose). They
appear in the theme and accent pickers like Lokal's own.

This build installs alongside the original app: applicationId
com.lokalkonnekt.konnekted2.skins, label 'Lokal Skins', and its own
launcher stickers (generated into the icon tool) with the LastWave lime CD
as the default. 18 theme/accent icon aliases in total.

Tests: lastwave_skins_test.dart (5) and the updated theme/launcher-icon
invariants all pass; verified on an emulator running both apps at once.
